# Evaluation artefacts — regenerate with `python tests/evaluate.py --json-out ...`
# The committed results/eval_full.json (synthetic) and results/eval_real.json
# (real audio) are kept on purpose as the README's source of truth; scratch runs
# go here.
results/*.json
!results/eval_full.json
!results/eval_real.json
*.npz

# REAL audio corpus — downloaded on demand by src/audio_fingerprint/corpus.py.
# NEVER commit audio: it is large and, though Creative-Commons, is not ours to
# redistribute. Provenance/attribution lives in the committed DATA_SOURCES.md.
data/

